				<div class="news standard">
					<div class="header">Tag Line Competition 2017 - Final Judgement
						<div>
							28-04-2017
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="content"><div id="poll-9-content" class="middle text small">The forum has spoken. Five cleverly thought up tag lines have been nominated for the final round of judgement. One will make it to the front page.<br/>&nbsp;<br/><div id="poll-9-question" class="text medium" style="width: 100%; text-align: center; position: relative;"><div style="position: absolute; top: -10px; left: 480px;"><img id="poll-9-closedSign" src="images/thisPollIsClosed.png"/></div>Cast your vote for the next TankTrouble tag line<br/><br/></div></div><table id="poll-9-results" style="height: 1px; margin: auto;"><tr><td><img src="images/pollSpacer250.png"/></td><td><table style="height: 100%;"><tr>
