					</div></div></div><a name="15-09-2016" id="15-09-2016"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						2 Billion Scraps But No Party Hats
						<div>
							15-09-2016
						</div>
					</div><div>While lunching the cantina's indistinguishably, grey grub of the day, the Scrapyard Scientist appeared on the intercom. He cleared his throat and solemnly announced that the Scrapyard had passed 2 billion scraps.<br>
							<br>
