					</div></div></div><a name="03-06-2016" id="03-06-2016"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Online BETA Update
						<div>
							03-06-2016
						</div>
					</div><div style="background: url('images/betaAccessNewsBackground.png') no-repeat;">Scientists have swatted the notorious control bug, that consumed Qs in the chat and caused controls to switch from arrow keys to WASD.<br>
				<br>
				Tanks have also been rearranged so that all player names are visible in even the most crowded mazes.<div class='social'>
