					</div></div></div><a name="11-05-2016" id="11-05-2016"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Poster Competition Deadline Approaching
						<div>
							11-05-2016
						</div>
					</div><div>On Friday the scientists will have a rare break, which we will spend in the cantina studying the submissions for the poster competition and voting for the best ones. If you haven't sent us your poster yet, hurry up - you can still make it! <b>Tomorrow, Thursday the 12th of May</b>, is the last chance!<br>
				<br>
				Read all about the competition and the great prizes <a href="#15-04-2016">here</a>.<div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
