					<div class="bottom">
					</div>
				</div><a name="11-03-2016" id="11-03-2016"></a><div class="news4 important" style=""><div>
						Important Message to Tank Owners
						<div>
							11-03-2016
						</div>
					</div><div>Do you have 2 tanks or more? If yes, then you must read this:<br>
				<br>
				From May 1st TankTrouble will allow only 1 tank per email address. If you have 2 or more tanks using the same email address, you must change the duplicate addresses now! Here's how:<br>
				<div style="text-align: center;">
					<img src="images/changeEmailInstructions.png">
				</div>
				<br>
				The details: On May 1st all duplicate email addresses will be deleted. That is, if you have 2 or more tanks that are using the same email address, only the tank that most recently logged in will keep its email address; the other tanks' email addresses will be deleted. No accounts will be deleted. You will still be able to log in with all your accounts even if their email was deleted, but if you forget their passwords there will be no way to retrieve them.<div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
							app_id: '1658540137729309',
