						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="29-01-2016" id="29-01-2016"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Win a BETA Membership
						<div>
							29-01-2016
						</div>
					</div><div>The development of Online BETA is progressing as planned and now we need more testers. On Friday (February 5th) we draw 10 lucky winners of a TankTrouble BETA Membership.<br>
				<br>
				See how you enter the competition on <a href="https://www.facebook.com/TankTrouble/posts/1129917583697685">Facebook</a>.<div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
