							name: '25 Jolly Pieces of Swag to Keep You Warm',
							description: 'The Countdown has Begun! Now a hard month of chowing down frosted cookies and roller-coasting blood sugar levels lies ahead. To ease the process the TankTrouble Swag Research Team has prepared an Advent calendar with jolly Christmas accessories. Log in every day to collect them all or the ones you are missing! Note to Santa: We are still waiting on that nuclear reactor!',
							caption: 'TankTrouble.com'
						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="29-11-2015" id="29-11-2015"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Online BETA Development Report
						<div>
							29-11-2015
						</div>
					</div><div style="background: url('images/betaAccessNewsBackground.png') no-repeat;">The Online BETA Weekend panned out successfully. Brave testers from all over the planet battled fiercely while TankTrouble scientists monitored the server load intensely. The servers pulled through without breaking a sweat. However, the test did reveal a few ungreased gears and thus we remain submerged deep into the core of the online servers greasing up for the next big test. We expect to surface with more news soon!<div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
							app_id: '1658540137729309',
							link: 'https://tanktrouble.com/?news#29-11-2015',
  					  		picture: 'https://tanktrouble.com/images/facebookShareDefault.jpg',
							name: 'Online BETA Development Report',
							description: 'The Online BETA Weekend panned out successfully. Brave testers from all over the planet battled fiercely while TankTrouble scientists monitored the server load intensely. The servers pulled through without breaking a sweat. However, the test did reveal a few ungreased gears and thus we remain submerged deep into the core of the online servers greasing up for the next big test. We expect to surface with more news soon!',
							caption: 'TankTrouble.com'
						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="30-10-2015" id="30-10-2015"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Online BETA Weekend - Pressing the Big Red Button!
						<div>
							30-10-2015
						</div>
					</div><div style="background: url('images/betaAccessNewsBackground.png') no-repeat;">The scientists have now temporarily opened Online BETA for all players! But beware: TankTrouble Online BETA is work in progress. Venturing into the glitchy bits and bytes of the Online BETA servers puts your tank at great risk. That's why we're handing out hazmat suits to everyone the entire weekend - log in now to claim yours! Keep your head down and expect things to blow up left and right!<div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
							app_id: '1658540137729309',
							link: 'https://tanktrouble.com/?news#30-10-2015',
  					  		picture: 'https://tanktrouble.com/images/facebookShareDefault.jpg',
							name: 'Online BETA Weekend - Pressing the Big Red Button!',
							description: 'The scientists have now temporarily opened Online BETA for all players! But beware: TankTrouble Online BETA is work in progress. Venturing into the glitchy bits and bytes of the Online BETA servers puts your tank at great risk. That\'s why we\'re handing out hazmat suits to everyone the entire weekend - log in now to claim yours! Keep your head down and expect things to blow up left and right!',
							caption: 'TankTrouble.com'
						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="29-10-2015" id="29-10-2015"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Online BETA Weekend - What to Expect?
						<div>
							29-10-2015
						</div>
					</div><div style="background: url('images/betaAccessNewsBackground.png') no-repeat;">Before TankTrouble Online BETA opens temporarily this weekend, there are a few things to keep in mind.
				<ul>
					<li>
						This BETA weekend is first and foremost a test. The online servers have only ever been exposed to a few BETA testers. Now we need to see how they perform under pressure. Most likely they will crash.
					</li>
					<li>
						TankTrouble Online is in BETA; it is work in progress, not everything is implemented yet and bugs do occur!
					</li>
					<li>
						To avoid a complete meltdown we have capped the number of simultaneously running battles on each server at 5, for starters. There will not be room for everyone.
					</li>
				</ul>
				Scientists keep their fingers crossed, lab rats fear the worst, and the Intern says he will not touch anything. See you online!<div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
							app_id: '1658540137729309',
							link: 'https://tanktrouble.com/?news#29-10-2015',
  					  		picture: 'https://tanktrouble.com/images/facebookShareDefault.jpg',
							name: 'Online BETA Weekend - What to Expect?',
							description: 'Before TankTrouble Online BETA opens temporarily this weekend, there are a few things to keep in mind. This BETA weekend is first and foremost a test. The online servers have only ever been exposed to a few BETA testers. Now we need to see how they perform under pressure. Most likely they will crash. TankTrouble Online is in BETA; it is work in progress, not everything is implemented yet and bugs do occur! To avoid a complete meltdown we have capped the number of simultaneously running battles on each server at 5, for starters. There will not be room for everyone. Scientists keep their fingers crossed, lab rats fear the worst, and the Intern says he will not touch anything. See you online!',
							caption: 'TankTrouble.com'
						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="22-10-2015" id="22-10-2015"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						Online BETA Opens for All Players Next Weekend
						<div>
							22-10-2015
						</div>
					</div><div style="background: url('images/betaAccessNewsBackground.png') no-repeat;">Up until now, the Online BETA servers have only been exposed to a limited and exclusive group of BETA testers,
				while TankTrouble scientists have been deploying improvements, fixing bugs and tweaking tweakable stuff.
				Now it is time to see if the nuts and bolt have been tightened enough.<br>
				<br>
				<div style="text-align: center;" class="text large">
					Next weekend<br>
					- Friday Oct 30th to Sunday Nov 1st -<br>
					we temporarily open Online BETA for all players!<br>
					<br>
				</div><div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
							app_id: '1658540137729309',
							link: 'https://tanktrouble.com/?news#22-10-2015',
  					  		picture: 'https://tanktrouble.com/images/facebookShareDefault.jpg',
							name: 'Online BETA Opens for All Players Next Weekend',
							description: 'Up until now, the Online BETA servers have only been exposed to a limited and exclusive group of BETA testers, while TankTrouble scientists have been deploying improvements, fixing bugs and tweaking tweakable stuff. Now it is time to see if the nuts and bolt have been tightened enough. Next weekend - Friday Oct 30th to Sunday Nov 1st - we temporarily open Online BETA for all players! ',
							caption: 'TankTrouble.com'
						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="12-10-2015" id="12-10-2015"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
						What's Cooking in the Laboratory?
						<div>
							12-10-2015
						</div>
					</div><div style="background: url('images/betaAccessNewsBackground.png') no-repeat;">The Laboratory has submerged deep into core components of the Online BETA servers. We have been doing lots of cleaning up of code and optimising, and the servers are now running as smooth as Dimitri's bald spot - almost (nothing's really that smooth). Besides loads of under-the-hood server optimisations, we did implement some groovy, new features. We especially like:
				<ul>
					<li>The Garage featuring - for starters - the BETA accessories!</li>
					<li>Explosive scores that explode!</li>
					<li>Groovy Terminator and Dominator badges that will command respect!</li>
					<li>The good ol' Scrapyard is back - now continuing the counting on Online BETA.</li>
				</ul>
				And we swatted bugs left and right. The most notorious were:
				<ul>
					<li>A nasty bug that caused your tank to sometimes appear twice.</li>
					<li>The occasional appearance of mysterious black boxes.</li>
				</ul><div class='social'>
						<div class='facebook' onclick="FB.ui({
							method: 'feed',
							app_id: '1658540137729309',
							link: 'https://tanktrouble.com/?news#12-10-2015',
  					  		picture: 'https://tanktrouble.com/images/facebookShareDefault.jpg',
							name: 'What\'s Cooking in the Laboratory?',
							description: 'The Laboratory has submerged deep into core components of the Online BETA servers. We have been doing lots of cleaning up of code and optimising, and the servers are now running as smooth as Dimitri\'s bald spot - almost (nothing\'s really that smooth). Besides loads of under-the-hood server optimisations, we did implement some groovy, new features. We especially like: The Garage featuring - for starters - the BETA accessories! Explosive scores that explode! Groovy Terminator and Dominator badges that will command respect! The good ol\' Scrapyard is back - now continuing the counting on Online BETA. And we swatted bugs left and right. The most notorious were: A nasty bug that caused your tank to sometimes appear twice. The occasional appearance of mysterious black boxes. ',
							caption: 'TankTrouble.com'
						}, function(response){});"><img src='../images/facebookLogoWhite.svg'><div class='caption'>Share</div></div>
					</div></div></div><a name="28-09-2015" id="28-09-2015"></a><div class="news4 standard" style=""><div>
