						</div>
					</div><div><div style="text-align: center;">
					And the winner is...<br>
					<br>
					<span class="text large" style="font-style: italic;">Home to tanks of weapons 'n' wits, watch out - you'll be blown to bits!</span>
				</div>
				<br>
				Poetry of destruction and ear candy to TankTrouble scientists! We have added this rhyming tag line to the front page where it will randomly pop up.<div class='social'>
